  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row22Member">東海東京フィナンシャル・ホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
